'Detective Camera' by James Newland (1892) - Karaoke version

This was my contribution to Art Hack Day: Afterglow at transmediale 2014. I asked other participants to join in for a collaborative sing-a-long. They saw the song for the first time.

Many thanks to everyone who participated!!!

Video produced by: Martin Dunkelmann, Stephan Walsch, Steffen Hammerich, Julia Freyhoff from Arte Creative.

For more info about the song and the camera:

http://nationalmediamuseumblog.wordpress.com/2013/09/12/detective-camera-stirns-waistcoat-camera/


- Niko Princen